    <label>gyro-stabilizers</label>
    <labelShort>gyro-stabilizers</labelShort>
    <description>Gyroscopic stabilizers built into the suit's frame, holding the wearer upright and on aim. Being hit no longer costs them the next few seconds.</description>
    <attachedTo>guy762_KotORMount_armortech</attachedTo>
    <effects>
      <statOffsets>
        <Mass>0.2</Mass>
